# 2. Queries

### 1. Patient number and ward number

```sql
SELECT pat_ID, Ward_num
FROM Patient;
```

---

### 2. Patient name and physician for patients assigned to any ward

```sql
SELECT p.pat_fname, p.pat_Lname, ph.Phy_fname
FROM Patient p
JOIN Physician ph ON p.phy_id = ph.Phy_ID
WHERE p.Ward_num IS NOT NULL;
```

---

### 3. Patients whose first name starts with 'D' treated by physician "Sreekumar"

```sql
SELECT p.*
FROM Patient p
JOIN Physician ph ON p.phy_id = ph.Phy_ID
WHERE p.pat_fname LIKE 'D%'
AND ph.Phy_fname = 'Sreekumar';
```

